<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>11_光学、医疗与精密仪器 (Instruments & Devices)</title><style>
body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; max-width: 1260px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; background: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; }
